Pattern: `[Primary Hexagram]之[Secondary Hexagram]` followed by verse
- Example: "乾之乾" → "道徙多阪，胡言连蹇..." [source:43c407553cb8]
- Example: "乾之坤" → "招殃来螯，害我邦国..." [source:43c407553cb8]

### 2.3 Text Format
- **Primary Structure**: Four-character lines (四言诗)
- **Occasional Variation**: Some three or five-character lines
- **Parallel Construction**: Common antithetical couplets

